WEBVTT

00:00:00.280 --> 00:00:01.140
Sophie...!

00:00:01.730 --> 00:00:03.770
Brother...?

00:00:04.190 --> 00:00:07.940
I was finally able to
bring you here, to El Dorado.

00:00:09.730 --> 00:00:12.900
B-Brother, what is this place?

00:00:13.490 --> 00:00:15.420
This is a world I've created.

00:00:15.910 --> 00:00:19.620
A world where anyone
can live happily. A true utopia.

00:00:21.120 --> 00:00:23.750
It has been a long time, El Dorado King!

00:00:23.960 --> 00:00:24.670
Huh?!

00:00:25.120 --> 00:00:29.750
Everyone keeps calling me King.
Such an exaggeration!

00:00:30.710 --> 00:00:34.510
As long as I have this ring,
everything will go as I plan.

00:00:34.510 --> 00:00:36.970
Take it off! Take it off right now!

00:00:37.180 --> 00:00:39.220
You can't use the power of Horrors!

00:00:39.220 --> 00:00:43.480
What in the world are
you talking about? Horrors?

00:00:44.980 --> 00:00:48.560
So many... So many people have died!

00:00:53.820 --> 00:00:54.550
Sophie?

00:01:13.710 --> 00:01:15.760
Of course, we can't take them!

00:01:16.510 --> 00:01:18.390
Is there any inheritance?

00:01:19.050 --> 00:01:21.060
What a troublesome thing.

00:01:25.060 --> 00:01:26.020
Just send them to a home.

00:01:26.020 --> 00:01:27.260
No way.

00:01:27.730 --> 00:01:29.820
There should be enough left to raise them.

00:01:50.330 --> 00:01:52.130
I will definitely protect Sophie.

00:01:53.590 --> 00:01:55.340
I will make a world

00:01:55.670 --> 00:01:58.030
where people can live
happily with no difficulties.

00:01:59.050 --> 00:02:02.750
Definitely, for Sophie.

00:02:12.310 --> 00:02:15.070
Sophie, why?

00:02:16.360 --> 00:02:21.980
These are all the people
who died because of your El Dorado.

00:02:48.480 --> 00:02:50.480
The dead don't return.

00:02:51.350 --> 00:02:55.400
A person who has become
a Horror can never change back.

00:02:58.490 --> 00:03:01.020
If so... If so!

00:03:04.030 --> 00:03:08.090
I will kill my brother myself!

00:03:19.050 --> 00:03:20.170
Why?

00:05:21.000 --> 00:05:23.010
Hey, now. What's going on?

00:05:23.010 --> 00:05:24.880
The Golden Knight is alive.

00:05:26.470 --> 00:05:30.050
Bastard. Did you truly dispose of him,

00:05:31.810 --> 00:05:33.020
just like King ordered you to?

00:05:36.480 --> 00:05:38.650
Even though he's the Golden Knight,

00:05:38.650 --> 00:05:41.860
he should have died
after being thrown into the vat.

00:05:42.020 --> 00:05:44.130
Hurry up and find the reason.

00:05:44.530 --> 00:05:46.630
I will not allow him to escape this time!

00:05:49.910 --> 00:05:53.040
Are there still bugs left in the system?

00:05:53.200 --> 00:05:54.070
But...

00:05:55.160 --> 00:05:55.730
Hm?

00:05:57.330 --> 00:05:59.710
What's this? A fight amongst siblings?

00:06:01.960 --> 00:06:06.500
A lot of things happened
after you disappeared, Brother.

00:06:07.840 --> 00:06:11.740
Really, a lot of things.

00:06:16.600 --> 00:06:18.730
A lot of people were sacrificed.

00:06:20.350 --> 00:06:24.550
Even though everyone only wanted happiness.

00:06:26.190 --> 00:06:29.250
Horrors steal it all. Everything.

00:06:32.410 --> 00:06:35.410
Even if you haven't realized
that you've become a Horror,

00:06:35.410 --> 00:06:37.960
you'll keep taking a lot of lives!

00:06:37.960 --> 00:06:40.410
Once you're a Horror,
you can't change back.

00:06:41.420 --> 00:06:47.100
You'll just...
You'll just keep taking more lives.

00:06:58.810 --> 00:07:00.600
Y-You're wrong! I'm...

00:07:00.600 --> 00:07:03.050
Sword and the others will be here soon.

00:07:03.730 --> 00:07:06.170
Once they know you've become a Horror,

00:07:07.480 --> 00:07:09.860
Sword will definitely kill you.

00:07:12.660 --> 00:07:15.970
I'll do it before that happens.

00:07:18.500 --> 00:07:24.110
For all the lives that
you sacrificed for my happiness.

00:07:26.500 --> 00:07:28.010
At the very least, I will do it!

00:08:28.110 --> 00:08:29.480
Why?

00:08:32.820 --> 00:08:35.950
People sent to the true El Dorado

00:08:35.950 --> 00:08:38.500
get their souls taken,
leaving their body to die.

00:08:39.370 --> 00:08:42.100
But Lizzy says that Sophie is still alive.

00:08:42.660 --> 00:08:45.520
I'm sure there's an administrator mode.

00:08:46.170 --> 00:08:50.380
It'd be a problem if Martin Hennes
entered to work on the system

00:08:50.380 --> 00:08:51.510
and couldn't leave.

00:08:52.670 --> 00:08:55.800
So Sophie's big brother was used.

00:08:57.760 --> 00:09:01.720
We're going to get Sophie back.
Everything is after that.

00:09:22.370 --> 00:09:23.550
--Shit!
--Sword!

00:09:34.920 --> 00:09:36.180
Awaken.

00:10:06.660 --> 00:10:07.290
Sword!

00:11:04.970 --> 00:11:05.930
Sophie!

00:11:18.570 --> 00:11:20.650
Why is no one answering?!

00:11:20.650 --> 00:11:23.240
Queen! Bishop! Knight!

00:11:24.030 --> 00:11:26.290
The emergency system isn't responding.

00:11:26.490 --> 00:11:30.940
The security around
the building is down? A bug?

00:11:31.580 --> 00:11:33.750
Of all times!

00:11:36.460 --> 00:11:41.470
Why is Sophie doing this?
Why did this happen?

00:11:48.560 --> 00:11:50.560
This company was no good, either.

00:11:52.270 --> 00:11:55.270
Cerebral scanning through retinal recognition

00:11:55.270 --> 00:11:58.190
as a connective method to a virtual world.

00:11:58.860 --> 00:12:02.820
Without getting a chip or
special drivers surgically installed,

00:12:02.820 --> 00:12:08.200
a method where anyone can
enter the same world of data.

00:12:09.750 --> 00:12:12.080
Why doesn't anyone understand?

00:12:12.370 --> 00:12:14.420
If this technology became a reality...

00:12:14.420 --> 00:12:16.130
...it would change the world.

00:12:18.130 --> 00:12:19.000
Martin?

00:12:21.010 --> 00:12:23.620
Sorry. I'm fine.

00:12:31.140 --> 00:12:33.100
I've already gotten so far.

00:12:33.770 --> 00:12:37.990
All that's left is to find an environment
where I can make this a reality.

00:12:45.030 --> 00:12:46.490
GarEden?

00:12:47.990 --> 00:12:49.710
The El Dorado project...

00:12:52.330 --> 00:12:58.230
They read my article and want me
to become their project leader?

00:13:03.300 --> 00:13:04.810
We have been waiting for you.

00:13:17.730 --> 00:13:18.700
What is this place?

00:13:20.020 --> 00:13:21.840
Welcome to GarEden.

00:13:22.440 --> 00:13:25.860
We will be supporting you, starting today.

00:13:26.240 --> 00:13:28.120
My name is Queen.

00:13:28.120 --> 00:13:31.040
This is the general manager, Bishop.

00:13:32.330 --> 00:13:35.420
As well as the GarEden
chief of security, Knight.

00:13:36.540 --> 00:13:42.000
We have prepared everything
you need for the El Dorado project.

00:13:42.000 --> 00:13:45.880
Please work freely and reach
your fullest potential, El Dorado King.

00:13:47.010 --> 00:13:49.760
El Dorado King?

00:13:49.760 --> 00:13:52.680
The ring that was given to you is proof.

00:13:55.350 --> 00:14:01.770
We shall lead mankind
to El Dorado, a new utopia.

00:14:02.400 --> 00:14:06.070
You are the King who will open that path.

00:14:10.410 --> 00:14:15.410
The company will take care of
your little sister's welfare as well.

00:14:15.910 --> 00:14:19.220
Please be at ease and focus on your research.

00:14:40.230 --> 00:14:42.660
Why not rest a little?

00:14:43.270 --> 00:14:44.510
Just a bit more.

00:14:45.650 --> 00:14:50.110
A bit more and I'll make a world
where everyone can live happily.

00:14:50.280 --> 00:14:54.640
A world for Sophie to
live without any difficulties.

00:14:54.640 --> 00:15:00.290
King, you always only think
about others and your little sister.

00:15:00.290 --> 00:15:03.390
Isn't there something
that you wish for as well?

00:15:04.340 --> 00:15:05.620
That, again?

00:15:07.300 --> 00:15:11.550
The only thing I want is for Sophie to smile.

00:15:16.600 --> 00:15:18.930
You really have
no darkness within you, King.

00:15:21.350 --> 00:15:23.050
What do you mean by darkness?

00:15:27.440 --> 00:15:28.630
This place is...

00:15:34.200 --> 00:15:36.950
Escape from the city! Hurry!

00:15:50.340 --> 00:15:51.190
What?!

00:16:18.990 --> 00:16:24.790
These are all the people
who died because of your El Dorado.

00:16:50.860 --> 00:16:52.740
This place has everything.

00:16:53.030 --> 00:16:55.700
Human wisdom, eternal peace,

00:16:56.160 --> 00:16:58.140
and overflowing abundance.

00:17:01.370 --> 00:17:02.200
Why?

00:17:02.500 --> 00:17:06.760
The only thing I want is for Sophie to smile.

00:17:07.670 --> 00:17:15.130
I did it for Sophie... For everyone...

00:17:15.630 --> 00:17:18.140
If so.... If so!

00:17:20.010 --> 00:17:23.890
I will kill my brother myself!

00:17:32.780 --> 00:17:34.030
Three years!

00:17:34.030 --> 00:17:37.270
It's been three years since you disappeared!

00:17:40.410 --> 00:17:47.070
What Sophie said was true...

00:17:48.710 --> 00:17:53.630
I... Because of me, everyone...

00:17:53.840 --> 00:17:55.470
Yeah, that's right.

00:17:55.470 --> 00:17:57.550
It's all your fault.

00:17:58.760 --> 00:18:05.060
That's why, Sophie...
Sophie tried to kill me...

00:18:05.060 --> 00:18:09.100
That's right.
That girl would never forgive you.

00:18:09.100 --> 00:18:12.970
Just like you, she is very pure.

00:18:13.440 --> 00:18:19.010
I made Sophie cry.
I pushed her into a corner!

00:18:19.740 --> 00:18:23.280
I wanted to make her happy...

00:18:24.660 --> 00:18:25.540
Me!

00:18:25.700 --> 00:18:28.650
That's right. It's your fault.

00:18:29.170 --> 00:18:34.420
You didn't wish for anything
except your little sister's happiness.

00:18:34.420 --> 00:18:41.310
If only you had more darkness
within you and drowned in desire.

00:18:42.050 --> 00:18:45.020
I would not have had to go so far.

00:18:47.230 --> 00:18:51.450
Now, what do you want to do?

00:18:59.240 --> 00:19:00.530
Your bullets don't even graze me.

00:19:02.490 --> 00:19:05.240
I am one of the three blades of El Dorado.

00:19:05.790 --> 00:19:08.660
The ultimate shield that protects King.

00:19:21.890 --> 00:19:23.040
Doing such useless things.

00:19:38.860 --> 00:19:40.320
It's useless.

00:19:41.990 --> 00:19:44.160
See you later, ugly.

00:20:30.160 --> 00:20:32.020
This isn't how it was supposed to be.

00:20:34.420 --> 00:20:35.410
Brother?

00:20:35.960 --> 00:20:39.890
We were supposed to become happy.

00:20:40.670 --> 00:20:42.300
This is all a lie.

00:20:44.150 --> 00:20:45.150
All of it.

00:20:45.890 --> 00:20:49.690
A reality like this. A little sister like this.

00:20:51.520 --> 00:20:53.140
Someone like me...

00:21:01.320 --> 00:21:03.820
Oh! It's finally started.

00:21:04.150 --> 00:21:07.010
He made us wait a really long time.

00:21:13.790 --> 00:21:15.670
Should all disappear.

00:22:10.220 --> 00:22:13.220
Sophie...

00:22:16.440 --> 00:22:18.350
Brother!
